Helm chart for [oas2mcp](https://github.com/therealm-tech/oas2mcp), which
exposes an OpenAPI document as a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server. It deploys
that server as an HTTP MCP endpoint over the Streamable HTTP or legacy SSE
transport.

## Installation

```bash
helm install petstore oci://ghcr.io/therealm-tech/charts/oas2mcp --version {{ template "chart.version" . }} --set oas2mcp.openapi.url=https://petstore3.swagger.io/api/v3/openapi.json
```

The [project README](https://github.com/therealm-tech/oas2mcp/blob/main/README.md)
introduces oas2mcp, and
[Deploying on Kubernetes](https://oas2mcp.therealm.tech/guides/kubernetes/)
covers the chart's use.

